        EB-)CAP003: Consume EVT-051 (outcome: hit)
        Note over CAP003: Sanctions hit on beneficiary<br/>Set InternationalTransfer.status = sanctions_blocked<br/>Raise MLRO alert (internal)<br/>OFSI notification required within 14 days (GOV-005-R02)
        CAP003->>EB: Publish EVT-057 TransferFailed<br/>{ transfer_id, reason: sanctions_block,<br/>sanctions_result_ref: scr-0099001 }
        Note over EB: Route EVT-057 → Notifications (SVC-053):<br/>Generic decline message (POCA 2002 s333A<br/>tipping-off prohibition — specific reason NOT disclosed)
        Channel-->>PER002: "We are unable to process this transfer.<br/>Please contact your Relationship Manager."
        Note over PER002: Journey ends<br/>InternationalTransfer.status: sanctions_blocked<br/>No funds transferred | MLRO alerted<br/>OFSI notification deadline: within 14 days
